      "title": "How to be a *better listener*"
    },
    {
      "type": "k",
      "n": 1,
      "title": "Put the phone *face down*",
      "body": "Your attention is the gift."
    },
    {
      "type": "k",
      "n": 2,
      "title": "Don’t plan *your reply*",
      "body": "Just listen until they’re done."
    },
    {
      "type": "k",
      "n": 3,
      "title": "Ask *“and then what?”*",
      "body": "Curiosity keeps them talking."
    },
    {
      "type": "k",
      "n": 4,
      "title": "Say it *back*",
      "body": "“So you felt…” shows you got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "k",
      "n": 5,
      "title": "Notice *what’s not said*",
      "body": "Tone, pauses, the sigh."
    },
    {
      "type": "k",
      "n": 6,
      "title": "Remember it *later*",
      "body": "Bring it up tomorrow. That’s listening."
    },
    {
      "type": "save",
      "title": "Save this *for your next deep talk.*",
      "sub": "Listening is a love language too."
    }
  ]
